::AfterSupplyChainCh2
@trigger OnOverarchingLoaded
@when   IsSolutionFoundFor(Design), IsSolutionFoundFor(Research), IsSolutionFoundFor(Supply)
@cutscene 
@once

@{Player}	P.A.L. did you get the fab bay cleaned up? 
@{PAL}		The fab bay is in perfect condition, as always. 
@{PAL}		...at least as perfect as it can be on an old clunker of a ship.
@{Player}	Clunker? As always? Looks like someone's system needs some updating...
{@PAL}		Oh, I think I hear something... sounds like you have an incoming call...

//call coming in from Quinn
{@Quinn}    Got the materials loaded Cap'!
{@Quinn}    Say, I noticed the last invoice I sent you was paid by Frontier Robots. What's up with that? 
{@Player} 	Um... yeah. I... well, I had to take a job with them because I ran into some debt. My ship got pretty beat up and the repair bill was pretty steep.
{@Quinn}	Oh dude. Bad luck. It can be rough out there. But I'm not sure about working with those guys.    
{@Player}   Really? I didn't know that. 
{@Player} 	Do you think you would be willing to continue as my hauler if I promise you'll be working with me directly?  
{@Quinn}	Ok sob story. I'll stick around for now. 
{@Player}  	You're a real friend. 
{@Quinn}   	Sure, sure. Let's just make sure I get paid. I gotta pay my haulers or they get pretty mad. 
{@Player}	Quinn, I promise you. See you later!

::AfterFabricationCh2 
@trigger OnOverarchingLoaded
@when   IsSolutionFoundFor(Design), IsSolutionFoundFor(Research), IsSolutionFoundFor(Supply), IsSolutionFoundFor(Fabrication)
@cutscene 
@once

{@Player}   P.A.L.? 
{@PAL}      Yes, Locke? 
{@Player}   What's the deal with Quinn and Frontier Robotics? Is there some kind of bad blood?  
{@PAL}      Frontier Robotics has a stellar reputation! Just check our reviews. We have great cash flow and always pay our invoices.  
{@PAL}      You know these cowboys out here. They can be pretty warry of outsiders.  
{@Player}   ...I guess. That makes sense.  
